  "construction_disclosure": "hypothesis.md's frozen words specify the book return as the weighted mean of legs' next_month_ret; the run implements E018's exact MARK-BASED cohort construction (adj_close month-end marks, decision month-end -> next decision month-end) because the frozen G1 anchor (smoke light_pass.mean_gross) is defined on E018's mark-based series - the label-based recompute misses it by ~44bp/mo, far beyond the 15bp tolerance, while the mark-based recompute reproduces it. The label-vs-mark gap is the measured 6.3e-4 timing offset (E018's break-even block); it is a near-constant across months and cancels in every between-bucket excess comparison. Disclosed post-hoc per the E013/E014 deviations rule; the guards, cuts and decision rule are unchanged."
